  m_text: "POWER RULE  /  n != -1\nIntegral of a*x<sup>n</sup> dx = a*x<sup>n+1</sup>/(n+1)
    + C\n\nTERM BY TERM\nIntegrate each term separately, then add one common +C.\n\nROOTS
    AND RECIPROCALS\nRewrite \u221Ax as x<sup>1/2</sup> before raising the exponent.\n\nDEFINITE
    INTEGRALS\nFind an antiderivative F, then compute F(upper) - F(lower). No +C
    in the result."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
